{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29077","headline":"戏代李协律松江有赠 · 许浑","name":"戏代李协律松江有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀客操琴吴女歌，明珠十斛是天河。\n霜凝薜荔怯秋树，露滴芙蓉愁晚波。\n兰浦远乡应解佩，柳堤残月未鸣珂。\n西楼沈醉不知散，潮落洞庭洲渚多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}